# Who reviews what (okf/concepts/contributing/maintainers.md).
#
# Maintainers are GitHub ACCOUNTS, never machines. Whoever holds one of these
# roles can triage, review, merge and release from any computer signed in with
# `gh auth login`; nothing in this repository assumes a particular device.
# Adding a maintainer is two steps: give the account the Maintain role on the
# repository, and add it here.
